rld government's  enemies could use the fruit's power  against them after all how can you go  out of your way to obtain this fruit and  awaken its true power if you don't know  what it really is or what its true power  actually entails but all of this makes  it clear that there were other users of  the gomugomonomi between Joy boy and  Luffy how would the godo say no that  unless it awakens the Nika fruit will  act as a paramecia type rubber-based  devil fruit they knew it because there  have been other users and the godose  were able to gather information about  those users the gorosei noticed that  Nika's true power simply wasn't  Awakening like it did with joy boy  during the void century and every time  another user would consume it it would  simply act as a paramecia-esque  rubber-based devil fruit when the user  died the fruit would reincarnate and the  process would be repeated this happened  for so long that the world government  seemed to have gotten used to it and  since Nika hadn't awakened in eight  centuries they didn't seem too worried  about it they kind of let their guard  down and so when they heard that a young  pirate from the East blue named Luffy  obtained a fruit that matches the  description of the Nika devil fruit they  didn't really worry too much about it  and they didn't go out of their way to  eliminate him at least not at first  after all the fruit has been passed  around for eight centuries and it never  became a threat so why would this time  be any different well as we all know  this time was certainly very different  and the world government is now  regretting its complacency but I am here  to tell you that just three years before  the birth of Luffy there was another  living user of the Nika fruit although  back then it was still just the  unawakened  gomogomunomi that person is none other  than the mother of Luffy's bro Ace and  the lover of the former pirate king  Goldie Roger I am of course talking  about podcast D Rouge unfortunately we  know very little about Rouge herself but  the one big thing that we do know about  her the one event that defines her as a  character is the key to unlocking the  secrets of the Nika devil fruit before  it ended up with Luffy Goldie Roger knew  that he was dying long before he  willingly gave himself up to the Marines  and so he had plenty of time to make  preparations for his epic final act the  very act which brought about a new  golden age of piracy one of the things  Roger did before giving himself up was  to leave his lover podcast the Rouge  with child and Rouge is believed to have  been about five months pregnant at the  time of Roger's execution because Cipher  pole somehow found out that Roger was  expect affecting a child the world  government forces attempted to find the  child they didn't want the only living  heir of the Legendary Pirate King to  challenge the world government in the  future and so they were determined to  eliminate the child before it ever had  the chance to become a threat the world  government did the math and they looked  for a child that could have been born  within nine months of Roger's execution  however they never could find Roger's  son and there is a very specific reason  for that Roger's pregnant lover Rouge  was living on the island of batarila in  the South blue as the world government  searched for hers and Rogers unborn  child and yes for you Spanish speakers  you can also pronounce it batteria or  baterija now in order to divert all  suspicion away from her son Ace Rouge  somehow managed to stay pregnant for 20  months instead of the normal 9 months  since this shouldn't even be possible  the world government was fooled and they  didn't take case away because they  didn't think that he could possibly be  Roger's son the math just didn't add up  when Ace was finally born Rouge secretly  named him gold dies in honor of his  father but soon after giving birth she  died because her body couldn't survive  the strai