h because I  was curious and the longest pregnancy  that resulted in a healthy birth appears  to have been just over 12 months this  pregnancy which occurred in 1945 seems  to have been well documented and  verified there have been women who claim  to have been pregnant for longer even as  long as 17 months but these claims have  not been verified and doctors are highly  skeptical that this is possible as far  as I've been able to find no one has  even tried to claim that they have been  pregnant for 20 months verified or  unverified so with that in mind we have  to consider the possibility that rouge's  20-month pregnancy wasn't achieved  through normal means we have to consider  the possibility that she had some sort  of Supernatural ability that allowed her  to do this and what better ability to  achieve this than a devil fruit that  gives your body the properties of rub  rubber a devil fruit that allows you to  stretch your insides at will enabling  your body to accommodate even a massive  20 month old baby thanks to Luffy's  gears we know that even the unawakened  gomugomunomi can be used to manipulate  the blood flow and oxygen circulation  within the user's body so this would  also explain how Rouge was able to keep  her baby alive under such extreme  conditions so if Rouge was really a user  of the gomugomonomi it is possible that  the devil fruit's body manipulation  abilities would allow both Rouge and her  baby to survive a 20-month pregnancy but  if Rouge really could accomplish all of  this then why did she die after giving  birth why didn't the gomugomonomi allow  her to Simply give birth and move on  like nothing happened well we have to  remember what an incredible ordeal it  would have been for Rouge to keep using  the devil fruits abilities constantly  for such a long period of time we know  how exhausted Luffy becomes when he  overuses his gears and how much recovery  time he usually needs in the past some  characters like Rob Lucci have even  speculated that using his gear Powers is  draining Luffy's life force and that it  could be reducing his lifespan so even  though Rouge wasn't like using Gear 3 or  gear 4 in battle she was still using her  power non-stop for months and months in  order to keep her baby alive long past  his due date and that would have taken a  terrible toll on her even someone with a  rubber body still has vital organs that  can't just be pushed beyond their limits  endlessly at some point they are going  to give out rubber or no rubber and that  seems to be what happened with Rouge she  pushed her pregnancy to 20 months in  order to save her son and while the  gomugomonomi allowed her to do that  physically the effort also took a  massive toll on her body her organs  couldn't take it anymore and soon after  giving birth she died after her death  the gomogomunomi was of course  reincarnated somewhere else and it was  eventually located and captured by  forces loyal to the world government but  the forces Royal to the world government  couldn't keep the fruit for long because  it was stolen by the red-haired Pirates  and taken to fuchsia village where it  was consumed by a young Luffy so the  timeline makes sense and just from a  narrative perspective the idea that  there have been other gobu gomonomi  users over the past 800 Years also makes  sense when the gorosei said that the  Nika devil fruit has a will of its own  and that it has seemingly actively  avoided them I'm sure they didn't mean  that the fruit literally bounces away  from the Marines and escapes them every  time they try to capture it the gorosei  were saying that every time they are  about to capture the devil fruit it  seems to find a new user and that user  takes it out of their grass the Nika  devil fruit may not have awakened in the  centuries between Joy boy and Luffy but  that doesn't mean that it wasn't used in  all that time now even though I came to  the Rouge is a former gomungomunomi user  theory on my own w