d criminals in the world and that  brings us back to Rouge a woman who did  what should have been literally  impossible in order to defy the world  government and deny them the opportunity  to hurt her son so every d-clan member  has defied the world government and the  celestial dragons in some important way  this is what they all have in common and  this could be the secret of the d-clan  whose Origins can be traced all the way  back to Joy boy and the ancient Kingdom  so the Nika devil fruit The Godly fruit  which has a will of its own may also be  subject to the will of Thee the Nika  fruit may also gravitate towards members  of the d-clan because they are directly  connected to the fruits of original user  joyboard the will of D could be part of  the reason why the Nika fruit has  managed to avoid capture by the world  government for so long the Nika devil  fruit could be connected to members of  the D Clan and it is possible that it  naturally gravitates to them and away  from the world government and the  celestial dragons if so then it would  make sense that the only two users we  know after Joy boy have been Rouge and  Luffy two members of the D Clan and if  this theory is in fact true then it also  leaves us with a very dark future for  One Piece after all Blackbeard is also a  member of the D Clan and he has the  ability to steal devil fruits therefore  if the Nika devil fruit gravitates  towards members of the d-clan Blackbeard  may attempt to steal this incredible  devil fruit from Luffy sometime in the  future the epic showdown between Luffy  and Blackbeard is inevitable but based  the one we know about the will of thee  thus far once their Showdown finally  begins both Luffy's life and his devil  fruit could be on the line now that we  are in the final Saga of the 1p story  things are really heating up like never  before and I can't wait to see what  happens next let me know what you guys  think do you agree with me that podcast  di Rouge was a user o